2:T500,<h2>Your Trusted <span class="ident">British Male Voiceover</span> Artist</h2>

<p>Need a British male voiceover that hits the mark every time?<br>25 years of experience and more than 100,000 scripts recorded, I’ve voiced for top global brands including <a href="https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/apple-voice-style" title="Apple voiceover" class="isred" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Apple</a>, <a href="https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/disney-store-marvel-voiceover" title="Disney voiceover" class="isred" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Disney</a>, <a href="https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/this-morning-spin-to-win-gameshow-voice" title="ITV voiceover" class="isred" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ITV</a> and the <a href="https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/bbc-radio-2-voice-of-santa" title="BBC Radio 2 voiceover" class="isred" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">BBC</a>. Warm, natural narration to high-energy character reads for commercials, explainer videos, eLearning, games, and more.<br>

As a multi-award-winning UK voiceover artist, clients come to me for quality, speed, and reliability. I deliver broadcast-ready audio from my pro studio, fast turnaround, easy communication, no drama. Let’s bring your script to life.
</p><br>3:T476,<br><h2><span class="ident">The UK’s No.1 Voice of Santa</span></h2>  
<p>It’s not Christmas without the Voice of Santa! As the go-to Santa for BBC, ITV, Heart Radio, and even Tesco, I’ve brought the magic of Christmas to life for years. From live broadcasts and national campaigns to personalised films and festive events, my <a href="/santa-voice" title="Professional Santa Voiceover by Guy Harris">Santa voice</a> is trusted by top brands to spread joy and cheer.  
<br>  
I also run <a href="https://www.santaradio.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Santa Radio, The World’s Biggest Online Christmas Radio Station">Santa Radio</a> — the world’s biggest online Christmas station, broadcasting festive favourites 365 days a year.  
<br>  
You might’ve heard me in campaigns for <a href="/masked-singer-voice-of-god-butlins" title="Masked Singer Voiceover for Butlins">Butlins</a>, ITV’s In for a Penny, and Paultons Park. A familiar festive voice across the UK. If your project needs an authentic, joyful Santa voice that captivates audiences, I can create the perfect Christmas atmosphere.</p><br>0:["tAFgy3oTCENJzQlp2G2wa",[[["",{"children":["voiceoverguy",{"children":["__PAGE__",{}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",{"children":["voiceoverguy",{"children":["__PAGE__",{},[["$L1",["$","main",null,{"className":"inner-page","children":[["$","section",null,{"className":"inner-hero","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-container","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h1><span class=\"ident\">Guy Harris</span> – British Male Voiceover Artist</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>“You may not know my name, but you've definitely heard my voice... <br>On the radio, TV, apps, video games, or even live events, my voice connects brands with audiences worldwide.”\r\n</p>"}}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-bar"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-parallax","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-container","children":[[["$","div","0",{"className":"inner-row","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2"}}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/images/voiceoverguy-who1.png","alt":"Guy Harris – British Male Voiceover Artist","style":{"width":"100%","borderRadius":4,"marginTop":8}}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"inner-row reverse","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<br><br><h2><span class=\"ident\">Versatile Voiceovers</span> for Every Brief</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>From <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" title=\"commercial voiceovers\">TV commercials</a> and narration to animation, live events, and game trailers, I deliver voiceovers tailored to each unique project. I’ve voiced <span class=\"isred\">Salty in Thomas & Friends</span>, narrated documentaries, and served as the Voice of God for global events like the International Gaming Awards.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Need something natural and sincere? Or a bold character voice that steals the show? Whether you’re after friendly, formal, funny or full-blown drama, I’ve got it covered.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>As a seasoned British male voiceover artist, I’ve adapted my delivery across countless industries – tech, retail, entertainment, education, finance, always keeping the end result crisp, compelling, and bang on brief. I'm happy with thousands of words too.</p><br>"}}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/images/voiceoverguy-skateboarder.jpg","alt":"Versatile Voiceover – Guy Harris","style":{"width":"100%","borderRadius":4,"marginTop":8}}]]}]]}],["$","div","2",{"className":"inner-row","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<br><br><h2>Professional Studio for <span class=\"ident\">Broadcast-Quality Audio</span></h2>\r\n<p>Based in West Yorkshire, I record from a fully equipped, state-of-the-art voiceover studio used daily by clients worldwide. Featuring premium microphones like the Neumann U87 and MKH 416, plus Source Connect and Cleanfeed for remote sessions, my setup guarantees exceptional sound quality.<br>\r\n\r\nWith 24-hour turnaround on most projects, you’ll get your audio fast and polished. TV, radio, or digital platforms, my <a href=\"/voiceover-studio\" title=\"Voiceover Studio Setup\">professional recording studio</a> ensures broadcast-quality results every time.</p><br>"}}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/images/voiceover-studio-yorkshire.jpg","alt":"Professional Voiceover Studio – Guy Harris","style":{"width":"100%","borderRadius":4,"marginTop":8}}]]}]]}],["$","div","3",{"className":"inner-full","children":[["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<br><h2><span class=\"ident\">The Voice Behind Big Brands</span> – Trusted, Booked, Proven</h2>\r\n<p>From global names like Samsung and Booking.com to national staples like the BBC, ITV, and Heart Radio, brands trust me to bring their message to life. I’ve added cheeky charm to <a href=\"/seabrooks-in-for-a-penny-sponsor-voiceover\" title=\"In for a Penny Voiceover\">In for a Penny</a> on ITV, brought festive sparkle as <a href=\"/santa-voice\" title=\"Santa Voice\">Santa on Capital Radio</a>, and delivered clear, friendly narration for Alton Towers’ safety announcements.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Each project, big or small, receives the same level of professionalism and polish. When it matters most, clients know they can count on me to deliver voiceovers that are memorable, engaging, and right on brief.</p><br>"}}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","div","4",{"className":"inner-row","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/images/voiceoverguy-character-voices.jpg","alt":"Character Voices – Guy Harris","style":{"width":"100%","borderRadius":4,"marginTop":8}}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Bringing <span class=\"ident\">Characters</span> to Life</h2>\r\n<p>Need a voice that adds real character? From <a href=\"/thomas-the-tank-engine-voice-of-salty\" title=\"Salty the Dockyard Diesel Voice\">Salty</a> and Winston in <em>Thomas & Friends</em> to Dracula at Paultons Park, I bring distinctive voices to animation and theme parks. My characters bring warmth, humour, and unmistakable personality to every project.\r\n<br>\r\nTrusted for my <a href=\"/david-attenborough-voice\" title=\"David Attenborough Impression\">David Attenborough impression</a>, used in films and promos, I voice characters for shows, events and radio ads and I voice goblins in <a href=\"/clash-of-clans-goblins-voiceover\" title=\"Clash of Clans Goblin Voiceover\">Clash of Clans</a>. My <a href=\"/animation-voiceovers\" title=\"Animation Voiceover Artist\">animation voiceover work</a> spans gaming, cartoons, and branded storytelling, combining creativity with precision to craft unforgettable characters.</p><br>"}}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]]}],["$","div","5",{"className":"inner-row reverse","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/images/guy-harris-uk-voice-of-santa.jpg","alt":"Guy Harris – UK Voice of Santa","style":{"width":"100%","borderRadius":4,"marginTop":8}}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$3"}}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]]}],["$","div","6",{"className":"inner-row","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/TqkdBK8mBW8","title":"YouTube video","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}],"$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Why Choose<span class=\"ident\"> VoiceoverGuy Harris?</span></h2>\r\n<p>With over 25 years of experience, 100,000+ projects, and collaborations with brands like \r\n<a href=\"/apple-voice-style\" title=\"Apple Voice Style\">Apple</a>, \r\n<a href=\"/disney-store-marvel-voiceover\" title=\"Disney Voiceover\">Disney</a>, \r\nand \r\n<a href=\"/bbc-radio-2-voice-of-santa\" title=\"BBC Voiceover Work\">BBC</a>, \r\nI’m one of the UK’s leading male voiceover artists. With my voice trusted choice worldwide. For more answers to questions do check out the <a href=\"/FAQ\" title=\"FAQ page\">FAQ page</a>.\r\n<br>\r\nWorking from my <a href=\"/voiceover-studio\" title=\"My Voiceover Studio\">broadcast-quality studio</a>, I deliver exceptional audio and bring versatility, professionalism, and energy to every project. Whether you need a natural read, a character voice, or a high-energy promo, \r\n<a href=\"/contact-guy\" class=\"isred\" title=\"Get in Touch\">Get in touch</a>.</p>"}}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]]}]],"$undefined"]}]}],[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"ProfilePage\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceoverguy#profilepage\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceoverguy\",\"mainEntity\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/#guyharris\",\"name\":\"Guy Harris\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk\",\"image\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-voiceover.png\",\"jobTitle\":\"British Male Voiceover Artist\",\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/voiceoverguy/\",\"https://www.youtube.com/user/voiceoverguyharris\"],\"description\":\"Guy Harris is an award-winning British voiceover artist with over 25 years of experience, known for his versatility in character voices such as Santa, Attenborough, Pirate, and Gameshow Host.\",\"alternateName\":\"VoiceoverGuy\",\"worksFor\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"VoiceoverGuy\"}}}"}}]]]}],null],null],null]},[null,["$","$L4",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","voiceoverguy","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L5",null,{}],"template